# Manmaria (0x14): AD_02_U's zodiac-tile doors, from ad_02_u_zodiac.walk (all twelve tiles in the bag: AD_06_U / AD_10_U chests and
# the AB-blood door, Gepetto = answer 4), resumed at AD_02_U:0.  Each door: circle opens the tile list on the frame, right moves the
# list cursor (it stays where the last tile was taken, across doors), circle places, right (door 0) / down (doors 1, 2) moves to
# the next frame, cross leaves.  Solutions (treasure ids, regs 0x348..0x358): door 0 0x8e 0x8b 0x7f, door 1 0x83 0x84 0x88, door 2
# 0x80 0x81 0x82; list order 0x82 0x80 0x8e 0x8a 0x7f 0x83 0x88 0x87 0x8b 0x81 0x84 0x8c (taken tiles leave it).  Timed presses (hold 1).
